e AI manages risk, entries, exits, trailing stops, and profit-taking completely autonomously.\n* **Automatic Market Traversal**: It doesn't ask you what to trade. It scans across Crypto (SOL, BTC, ETH) and Futures (NQ, ES, Gold) simultaneously, automatically deploying capital only to where the highest mathematical edge exists right now.\n* **15% Unbreakable Iron Shield**: The emergency handbrake remains hardwired at the kernel level. If a black swan hits, the Mastermind locks the vault doors instantly.\n\n---\n\n### The Ultra-Clean \"Peak Monstrosity\" Interface\nInstead of messy cards and tiny buttons scattered everywhere, the interface becomes a **sleek, high-tech monolithic command console**:\n\n1. **The Mastermind Pulsing Core (The Centerpiece)**:\n   * A dark, glowing, high-tech cybernetic neural orb that pulses with life.\n   * Displays its current state: `MASTERMIND ACTIVE • SYNAPSES: 42,910 • WISDOM: LEVEL 14 • 81.4% ACCURACY`.\n   * Real-time thought ticker: A single streaming line of the Mastermind's internal dialogue:\n     * *“Absorbing NQ order book imbalance (+0.54)... Volume profile cleared... Executing 1:3 asymmetric long... Weight updated.”*\n\n2. **The Clean Stepped Equity Apex**:\n   * One massive, beautiful, glowing stair-step equity curve showing pure capital growth without visual clutter.\n\n3. **The Core Vital Telemetry (Only 3 Monolithic Metrics)**:\n   * **Total Capital ($)**: The live compounding balance.\n   * **All-Time Win Rate & P&L**: Net gains with Sharpe Ratio badge.\n   * **Risk Armor Status**: 100% active, 0.75% sizing, 0 strikes.\n\n---\n\n### The Bottom Line\nInstead of a messy dashboard with 20 buttons you have to babysit, this becomes **one dominant, autonomous financial intelligence** that runs on its own, teaches itself on its own, and sharpens its claws every single hour of the day.\n\nIf you say the word, I will redesign and unify the entire dashboard into this **clean, ultra-sleek, all-in-one Autonomous Mastermind** right 