{"step_index":1162,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-19T18:06:59Z","input_tokens":3549,"cache_read_tokens":208333,"output_tokens":839,"content":"**Yes, absolutely.** We have the full `marketing-psychology` skill installed and active at [`~/.gemini/config/skills/marketing-psychology/SKILL.md`](file:///Users/dev/.gemini/config/skills/marketing-psychology/SKILL.md).\n\nIt is a comprehensive behavioral science engine covering **40+ cognitive biases, mental models, and decision frameworks**, including:\n\n* **Hick’s Law & Cognitive Load**: Every extra option and toggle reduces user action and creates decision fatigue. *(This is exactly why your instinct to eliminate messy multi-modes and compress everything into **one automatic Mastermind** is psychologically superior).*\n* **Loss Aversion (Kahneman & Tversky)**: Pain of losing is $2\\times$ stronger than the joy of winning. *(Why highlighting the **15% Circuit Breaker** and **2-Strike Lockout** builds $10\\times$ more trust than just flashing green numbers).*\n* **BJ Fogg Behavioral Model ($B = MAP$)**: Motivation, Ability, Prompt. Making the agent **100% automatic** lowers the barrier of ability to zero—pure effortless execution.\n* **Anchoring & Framing**: Anchoring perceived value against institutional hedge-fund grade tools.\n* **Social Proof & Fluency**: High-credibility statistical transparency over gimmicky hype.\n\n### How We Can Apply It Right Now\nWe can use this skill immediately to **re-engineer the UI and messaging** of your Mastermind:\n1. **Apply Hick's Law**: Strip out all the mode toggles, manual knobs, and cluttered panels.\n2. **Apply The Effortless Mastery Frame**: Present the system as a single, sovereign **Autonomous Mastermind** that trains 24/7 without requiring human effort.\n3. **High-Impact Copy & Positioning**: If you want to showcase this, record content, or market it as a product, we can generate high-converting hooks, landing page copy, and psychological positioning using these exact frameworks.","thinking":"Initial assessment confirms the presence of the `marketing-psychology` skill, as well as the autonomous marketing policy. Considering the implications of these resources on any upcoming marketing tasks.\n\n\n"}
