ent suggests maximizing earnings involves leveraging marketing psychology autonomously. Considering user's well-being is critical, the \"peak monstrosity\" must avoid causing harm, emphasizing ethical and sustainable income generation. The focus will be on identifying marketing strategies with the highest conversion potential that align with ethical boundaries.\n\n\nThe most effective monetization strategy involves a high-converting ecosystem built on software, media, and psychology, rather than a simple trading bot. Product positioning will be key; instead of a bot, the focus shifts to an \"Autonomous Capital Preservation Core\" to combat emotional trading. The aim will be zero cognitive load for users via minimal settings and emphasizing risk mitigation using Loss Aversion.\n\n\nMonetization focuses on three core vehicles: Prop Firm Funding, a Viral Content Funnel, and a Signal Desk for premium access. Prop firm trading leverages high leverage with minimal personal risk to generate profit splits. The content funnel utilizes the live UI to capture audience interest across social media, driving organic traffic.\n\n\n","truncated_fields":["content"]}
