he desk during red economic news events? |\n| **4. Win-to-Loss Ratio** | **$\\ge 2:1$ R:R** | Were the wins significantly larger than the losses? |\n\n---\n\n### The Next Step\nWhenever you are ready:\n* We can connect **Bybit’s live real-time WebSocket feeds** (for BTCUSDT and SOLUSDT) directly into your Mastermind.\n* It will stream actual real-world price action and order book imbalances 24/7, tracking a live virtual wallet so your 30-day trial begins with **\\$0 risk**.","thinking":"The user proposes a phased approach to testing the system: a month-long evaluation with simulated funds on a platform like Bybit before committing real capital. This staged deployment allows for performance assessment and system maturation. If the initial trial proves unsuccessful, the user intends to delay real-money integration until the system's performance improves.\n\n\nThat plan is the epitome of disciplined risk management; it perfectly embodies forward-testing principles. It will validate the system's performance against real market data before any actual capital is risked, ensuring empirical proof of profitability over time. Such a cautious approach minimizes financial exposure while maximizing the opportunity to refine and mature the system.\n\n\n"}
