:17:43+05:30.\r\n</ADDITIONAL_METADATA>\r\nStep 465: <USER_REQUEST>\r\ndo it\r\n</USER_REQUEST>\r\n<ADDITIONAL_METADATA>\r\nThe current local time is: 2026-10-19T14:18:26+05:30.\r\n</ADDITIONAL_METADATA>\r\nStep 597: <USER_REQUEST>\r\nso now what i should do?\r\n</USER_REQUEST>\r\n<ADDITIONAL\n<truncated 1883 bytes>\nt analyzes the market, it learns, it gets experience, it evolves... so that the more experien\r\nStep 1148: <USER_REQUEST>\r\nwhat else can we do it make it evolve on it own, adapt and be professional on its job?\r\n</USER_REQUEST>\r\n<ADDITIONAL_METADATA>\r\nThe current local time is: 2026-10-19T23\r\nStep 1151: <USER_REQUEST>\r\nwhat else, i want this to peakly perform on its role\r\n</USER_REQUEST>\r\n<ADDITIONAL_METADATA>\r\nThe current local time is: 2026-10-19T23:31:09+05:30.\r\n</ADDITIONAL_METADAT\r\nStep 1154: <USER_REQUEST>\r\nlisten, i dont want any multi modes and lots of stuff compressed inside this. even now it looks complex and messy. just make it automatic. all the modes together or \r\nStep 1157: <USER_REQUEST>\r\ndo we have the marketing psychology skill?\r\n</USER_REQUEST>\r\n<ADDITIONAL_METADATA>\r\nThe current local time is: 2026-10-19T23:36:47+05:30.\r\n</ADDITIONAL_METADATA>\r\nStep 1163: <USER_REQUEST>\r\nwith it now tell me what is the peak monstrosity we can make this agent to earn money for me\r\n</USER_REQUEST>\r\n<ADDITIONAL_METADATA>\r\nThe current local time is: 2026-10\r\nStep 1166: <USER_REQUEST>\r\ni only have 5-10 dollars with me. is it enough? if not adapt to this in our strategy\r\n</USER_REQUEST>\r\n<ADDITIONAL_METADATA>\r\nThe current local time is: 2026-10-19T23:4\r\nStep 1169: <USER_REQUEST>\r\nim only focused on working in trading. not promoting dashboard. so what can we do?\r\n</USER_REQUEST>\r\n<ADDITIONAL_METADATA>\r\nThe current local time is: 2026-10-19T23:42:\r\nStep 1172: <USER_REQUEST>\r\nno what i will do is run with bybit or something for about a month. if it seems profitable, i will add real money. if not i will wait till the system gets enough exp\r\nStep 1175: <USER_REQUEST>\r\nfirst of all we didnt make this agent a monster. just however, one Matermind, trained and training everyday. getting better day by day endlessly. so now tell me what\r\nStep 1178: <USER_REQUEST>\r\nbbefore that, do you remember the first video? with little agent avatars and satisfying motion like animations showing what those agents do and stuff in the dashboar\r\n\n","truncated_fields":["content"]}
